linux-m8x (6.1.51-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Custom built Linux kernel for Amlogic Meson8 / Meson8m2 TV boxes.
  * Patches and configuration derived from the hexdump0815 stb-m8x recipe,
    which carries the meson8 changes from the xdarklight tree.
    See github.com/hexdump0815/linux-mainline-and-mali-generic-stable-kernel
  * Adds device trees for MINIX NEO X8-H, Tronsmart MXIII and M8S (dvfs).

 -- Antoni Aloy Torrens <aaloytorrens@gmail.com>  Thu, 16 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0000
